  "description": "Let's face it, some kids are stone-cold singletrack killers. If you have a fierce flier in your family, get the Flightline Two 24\", with its streamlined frame design, 50mm travel fork, Tektro mechanical disc brakes, and wide-ratio 24-speed drive train, and watch them master the trail.\nNew Haro Flightline Two 24\" FL3G 6000 Series alloy frame w/ IS disc mount\nSuntour XCT-JR-DS 24\" fork w/ 50mm travel, 1-1/8\" steerer, disc post mount\n1-1/8\" Threadless headset\nSuntour XCC 42/34/24T alloy crankset\nSealed cartridge BB set\nNew Shimano TY-700 front derailleur\nShimano Altus RD-M310 rear derailleur\nShimano EF510 Easy Fire, 3x8-Speed shifters w/ 2-3 finger levers\nShimano 8-speed 12-32t cassette\nLight Pivit alloy 25mm riser bar, 31.8mm\nDH 18 alloy double wall rims w/ Pivit alloy cassette 32h hubs\nKenda Small Block Eight 24 x 1.95\" tires",
